---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Under construction" description="The PROTORHEXIS institutional website is under construction. Explore our public engineering roadmap.">
  <div class="construction">
    <header class="construction-head">
      <div class="identity" aria-label="PROTORHEXIS"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/mark.svg" alt="" width="35" height="35" /></span><span class="identity-copy"><span class="site-name">PROTORHEXIS</span><span class="site-descriptor">RESEARCH / ENGINEERING NETWORK</span></span></div>
      <button class="lang-button" type="button" data-lang-button aria-label="Switch to English">EN</button>
    </header>
    <main class="construction-main" id="main">
      <div><div class="overline">INSTITUTIONAL WEBSITE / PREPARATION</div><h1><span data-zh="网站建设中。" data-en="WE ARE">网站建设中。</span><br /><span data-zh="工程仍在继续。" data-en="BUILDING.">工程仍在继续。</span></h1>
        <p class="lead" data-zh="PROTORHEXIS 的机构网站仍在设计中。工程路线图作为独立的公开界面开放，展示系统方向与未来经过审核的工程进展。" data-en="The PROTORHEXIS institutional website is still being designed. Our separate engineering pages explain systems and future reviewed progress.">PROTORHEXIS 的机构网站仍在设计中。工程路线图作为独立的公开界面开放，展示系统方向与未来经过审核的工程进展。</p>
      </div>
      <aside><p class="side-title">AVAILABLE / ENGINEERING</p><p data-zh="当前仅开放工程路线图。机构官网与工程页面采用不同的视觉体系。" data-en="The engineering roadmap is available now. It has a different visual system from the future institutional website.">当前仅开放工程路线图。机构官网与工程页面采用不同的视觉体系。</p><div class="link-row"><a class="outline-link" href="/roadmap/"><span data-zh="进入开发路线图" data-en="Open roadmap">进入开发路线图</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="outline-link" href="/roadmap/systems/"><span data-zh="查看系统图谱" data-en="System map">查看系统图谱</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></aside>
    </main>
    <footer class="construction-foot">PROTORHEXIS / <span data-zh="机构网站建设中" data-en="INSTITUTIONAL SITE IN PREPARATION">机构网站建设中</span> · <a href="https://github.com/PROTORHEXIS" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB ORGANIZATION ↗</a></footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
